sequenceDiagram
    %% Main successful flow; validation and alternatives are described in the guide.
    participant P0 as Duke
    participant P1 as ListSalesCommand
    participant P2 as OrderList
    participant P3 as Ui
    P0->>P1: execute(...)
    P1->>P2: getConfirmedSales()
    P2-->>P1: Non-cancelled orders
    P1->>P3: showSales(sales)
